WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.286
Send the completed prompt.

00:00:04.286 --> 00:00:08.135
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:08.135 --> 00:00:10.137
The generated widget is ready.

00:00:10.141 --> 00:00:13.243
Select Inference and inspect what changes in the process.

00:00:13.243 --> 00:00:16.271
Switch to Retrieval and compare its effect on context.

00:00:16.271 --> 00:00:21.888
Reveal a decision check and compare the explanation.
